<title>UK: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT NORTHAMPTONSHIRE IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA BEAT NORTHAMPTONSHIRE IN ONE-DAY MATCH.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHAMPTON, England 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Northamptonshire on faster run rate after their one-day match was abandoned because of rain.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 232 all out in 47.4 overs. Northamptonshire 134-5 after 35 overs when play was halted.</p>
</text>
